## SQ-LOOT-05 | the tuning tables load from the jar when the pack-folder copies are gone
@group A
@commands Scratch copy: move `kubejs/data/creativeloot/kubejs/loot/loot_config.json` and `loot_index.json` away; boot
@pass Tuning loads from the jar (`CLResources`); the `[loot-tuning]` line equals SQ-LOOT-01's
@fails `CLResources.text` path, or the json missing from the jar (the jar task checks both)
shell ! ls kubejs/data/creativeloot/kubejs/loot/loot_config.json kubejs/data/creativeloot/kubejs/loot/loot_index.json 2>/dev/null
kjsreject \[loot-tuning\] (could not read|disabled: missing)
kjsexpect \[loot-tuning\] \d+ rules -> rewrote \d+ tables
@draft a boot of its own: move the two files out of OUT/srv/kubejs/data/creativeloot/kubejs/loot/ before the boot (no setup step for that yet); the steps above are the checks after it
